{"t":"TSCO","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Tractor Supply Company","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Specialty Retail","employees":54000,"hq":"Brentwood, TN, United States","website":"https://www.tractorsupply.com","summary_en":"Tractor Supply Company operates as a rural lifestyle retailer in the United States. The company provides various merchandise, including livestock and equine feed and equipment, poultry, fencing, and sprayers and chemicals; companion animal products, such as food, treats, and equipment for dogs, cats, and other small animals, as well as dog wellness products; seasonal and recreation products comprising tractors and riders, lawn and garden, bird feeding, power equipment, and other recreational products; truck, tool, and hardware products, such as truck accessories, trailers, generators, lubricants, batteries, and hardware and tools; and clothing, gift, and décor products consist of clothing, footwear, toys, snacks, and decorative merchandise. It offers its products under the 4health, Paws & Claws, American Farmworks, Producer's Pride, Bit & Bridle, Red Shed, Blue Mountain, Redstone, C.E. Schmidt, Retriever, Country Lane, Ridgecut, Countyline, Royal Wing, Country Tuff, Strive, Dumor, Traveller, Farm Table, Treeline, Groundwork, TSC Tractor Supply Co, Huskee, Untamed, JobSmart, and Impeckable brand names. The company operates its retail stores under the Tractor Supply Company, Petsense by Tractor Supply, and Orscheln Farm and Home names; and operates websites under the TractorSupply.com and Petsense.com names. It sells its products to recreational farmers, ranchers, and others. Tractor Supply Company was founded in 1938 and is based in Brentwood, Tennessee.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Tractor Supply Company는 미국에서 농촌 라이프스타일 소매업체로 운영되고 있습니다. 이 회사는 가축, 말 사료 및 장비, 가금류, 울타리, 분무기 및 화학 물질을 포함한 다양한 상품을 제공합니다. 개, 고양이 및 기타 작은 동물을 위한 음식, 간식, 장비와 같은 반려 동물 제품과 개 건강 제품; 트랙터와 라이더, 잔디밭과 정원, 새 먹이주기, 전력 장비, 기타 레크리에이션 제품으로 구성된 계절 및 레크리에이션 제품; 트럭 부속품, 트레일러, 발전기, 윤활유, 배터리, 하드웨어 및 도구와 같은 트럭, 도구 및 하드웨어 제품; 의류, 선물 및 장식 제품은 의류, 신발, 장난감, 스낵 및 장식 상품으로 구성됩니다. 4health, Paws & Claws, American Farmworks, Producer's Pride, Bit & Bridle, Red Shed, Blue Mountain, Redstone, C.E. Schmidt, Retriever, Country Lane, Ridgecut, Countyline, Royal Wing, Country Tuff, Strive, Dumor, Traveller, Farm Table, Treeline, Groundwork, TSC Tractor Supply Co, Huskee, Untamed, JobSmart 및 Impeckable로 제품을 제공합니다. 브랜드 이름. 이 회사는 Tractor Supply Company, Petsense by Tractor Supply 및 Orscheln Farm and Home 이름으로 소매점을 운영하고 있습니다. TractorSupply.com 및 Petsense.com 이름으로 웹사이트를 운영하고 있습니다. 레크리에이션 농부, 목장주 및 기타 사람들에게 제품을 판매합니다. Tractor Supply Company는 1938년에 설립되었으며 테네시 주 브렌트우드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":36.935,"mcap":19153520640.0,"pe":19.857527,"fpe":17.91196,"peg":2.178,"ps":1.2014401,"pb":7.209643,"ev_ebitda":13.422,"div":2.61,"beta":0.484,"hi52":56.94,"lo52":28.36},"fin":{"rev":15942134784.0,"rev_g":0.051,"eps_g":-0.121,"gross":0.36285,"op":0.08701,"net":0.061300002,"roe":0.37347,"fcf":126797000.0,"cash":198876000.0,"debt":6720134144.0,"de":252.586,"eps":1.86,"feps":2.06203},"own":{"short":0.0871,"inst":0.96973,"insider":0.00262},"analyst":{"n":27,"mean":37.48148,"median":38.0,"high":43.0,"low":31.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.1,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Telsey Advisory Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":40.0,"priorPriceTarget":38.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":34.0,"priorPriceTar